sequenceDiagram
    title HIS and Agent Lab interface
    participant LabUser
    participant HISUI
    participant HISAPI
    participant HISDatabase
    participant Agent

    LabUser->>HISUI: Receive specimen
    HISUI->>HISAPI: mark_received_once
    HISAPI->>HISDatabase: Save receive timestamps
    HISAPI->>Agent: POST /api/orders
    Agent-->>HISAPI: 202 queued or 200 duplicate
    HISAPI->>HISDatabase: Save dispatch status
    HISAPI-->>HISUI: Receive and send status
    Agent->>HISAPI: POST hl7_order_status_sync
    HISAPI->>HISDatabase: Update agent status
    Agent->>HISAPI: POST hl7_result_upsert
    HISAPI->>HISDatabase: Dedupe result_uid
    HISAPI->>HISDatabase: Match order and obs_code
    HISAPI->>HISDatabase: Append receipt and upsert result
    HISAPI->>HISDatabase: Map partial or completed
    HISAPI-->>Agent: created true or false
